get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/characters/{{playerName}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  ## Character read

  Read a character by name.

  - Method and path: `GET /api/v1/characters/{{playerName}}`.
  - Auth: valid HMAC signature only; no `X-GM-Actor` and no RBAC permission.
  - Success: `200` with `{"guid","name","account_id","account_name","level","race","class","online"}`.
  - Failure: `401` bad signature, `404 target_not_found` when the character does not exist,
    `405` wrong method, `409` replayed nonce, `429` rate limited, `503 world_unavailable`.

  Replace `{{playerName}}` with any character name.
}
